        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bryce Courtenay, Juan Carlos Onetti\n- Works: Matthew Flinders' Cat\n- Roles: Advertising director, novelist, short story author\n- Places: South Africa, Australia, Montevideo, Madrid\n- Organizations: Viking Press\n\nFacts:\n- Juan Carlos Onetti was born on July 1, 1909, in Montevideo and died on May 30, 1994, in Madrid.\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges was an Uruguayan novelist and author of short stories.\n- Bryce Courtenay was born on August 14, 1933, and died on November 22, 2012.\n- Bryce Courtenay was a South African/Australian advertising director and novelist.\n- Matthew Flinders' Cat is a 2002 novel by Bryce Courtenay.\n- Viking Press published Matthew Flinders' Cat.",
